{"id": "t069-002", "text": "Graham is properly obsessed with Hearts this season. He's got a season ticket now and goes with his son every other Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Hearts", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this season"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "got a season ticket", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every other Saturday"}]}
{"id": "t069-003", "text": "Coffee with Amara on Thursday at 10am was moved to Friday at half 10, same place.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Coffee", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 10am"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at half 10", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t069-006", "text": "Jen's trip to Iceland is off. Her boss cancelled her leave at the last minute and she's fuming.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the last minute"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fuming", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t069-007", "text": "Need to post Oisín's birthday card by Wednesday morning. His birthday is 22/05 and he'll be in Galway.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "post Oisín's birthday card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oisín", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Wednesday morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "22/05", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t069-011", "text": "Marcus plays bass in a covers band called The Late Shift, mostly nineties Britpop with the odd Motown number thrown in. They've got a gig at the Crown on Friday at 8pm and he's nervous because it's their first one with a new drummer, who only joined three weeks ago. He's been rehearsing every evening this week. I should go along and support him, and maybe bring Uma.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "plays bass in a covers band called The Late Shift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "nineties Britpop", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Motown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig at the Crown", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 8pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "drummer", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks ago"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening this week"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "go along and support him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring Uma", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uma", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t069-014", "text": "Leon is a big chess player, plays online most evenings and has a club night on Tuesdays. Rated about 1800 apparently.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leon", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "chess", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "most evenings"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesdays"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Rated about 1800", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t069-021", "text": "Jaya has a job interview at the British Museum on the 12th at half 9. She's been prepping for weeks. Should message her good luck the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job interview at the British Museum", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th at half 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "weeks"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t069-022", "text": "Dorota is flying home to Kraków on 18 December and staying until the 6th of January. She's taking her partner Fern to meet the family for the first time, and Fern is quite nervous about it, especially about Christmas Eve dinner with her grandmother, who speaks no English. Dorota has been teaching her a few Polish phrases in the evenings. I said I'd water their plants while they're away.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying home to Kraków", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "18 December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the 6th of January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fern", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fern", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite nervous", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Christmas Eve dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "speaks no English", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the evenings"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "while they're away", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t069-023", "text": "Yetunde is crazy about Formula 1. She's a Ferrari fan, despite everything, and she's going to Silverstone in July.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yetunde", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Formula 1", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Ferrari", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Silverstone", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in July", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t069-026", "text": "Siobhan and her husband are celebrating their 25th anniversary with a cruise round the Norwegian fjords in September. They leave from Southampton on the 12th at 4pm and are away for ten nights. It's the first proper holiday they've had since the kids were small. She keeps hinting that they'd love a nice big photo frame for the pictures. Must get a card and a frame before they go.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siobhan", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "25th anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cruise round the Norwegian fjords", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th at 4pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "ten nights", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a nice big photo frame for the pictures", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card and a frame", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before they go", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t069-035", "text": "Long chat with Jen on the phone tonight. She's thinking of leaving her job at the bank and spending six months travelling around South East Asia, starting in Bangkok in January. Her parents aren't thrilled. She asked if I'd look after her cat Pepper while she's away, and I said probably yes. Her flat lease ends on 31/12, so she has to decide by November whether to renew. I should check in with her next week to see where she's landed.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "job at the bank", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "six months", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "travelling around South East Asia", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "aren't thrilled", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "while she's away", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flat lease ends", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "31/12", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "by November"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d7", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t069-040", "text": "Marcus said the gig was cancelled because the drummer broke his wrist. He's gutted. They're trying to rebook for next month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "drummer", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "broke his wrist", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month"}]}
{"id": "t069-042", "text": "Femi supports Arsenal and gets very upset after a loss. Avoid football talk on Mondays.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Arsenal", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "upset after a loss", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Avoid football talk", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Mondays", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t069-044", "text": "Dev is a keen birdwatcher and is going to Shetland in May to see the puffins at Sumburgh Head. He's been on about it for years and has a whole spreadsheet of species he wants to tick off, including a snowy owl if he's very lucky. He takes the overnight ferry from Aberdeen on 10 May at 5pm. He asked to borrow my good binoculars, so I need to post them to him by the end of April.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "birdwatcher", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Shetland", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "years"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "10 May at 5pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "post them to him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of April", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t069-046", "text": "Text Ciara on the 14th to see how Biscuit's stitches are healing.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text Ciara", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t069-047", "text": "Emily's brother Oisín is emigrating to New Zealand in the spring. He's got a job lined up at a hospital in Wellington and flies out on 2 April. Emily is quite upset about it but trying to be positive, and says their mum has been crying every time it comes up. Their whole family is having a farewell dinner on 15 March at 7pm. I should get him a little leaving present, maybe a good travel pillow for the flight.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oisín", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "emigrating to New Zealand", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job lined up at a hospital in Wellington", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 April", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite upset", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to be positive", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "crying every time it comes up", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "farewell dinner", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 March at 7pm", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get him a little leaving present", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t069-050", "text": "Mila's grandad died last week. The funeral is on Wednesday at 11am in Cork. Must send a card to her and her mum.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday at 11am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a card to her and her mum", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t069-054", "text": "Fern and Dorota's flight to Kraków was moved to 19 December at 6.15am. Fern is not a morning person, so that will be interesting.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fern", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flight to Kraków", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "19 December at 6.15am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fern", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not a morning person", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t069-056", "text": "Vanessa asked if I could FaceTime her on Sunday at 6pm her time. She's in Vancouver for work until the end of the month and is getting homesick. She's been spending her weekends hiking and went whale watching last Saturday, which she loved. Her husband Marcus and the kids are flying out to join her for the last week, from the 24th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vanessa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday at 6pm her time"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "in Vancouver for work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "homesick", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "hiking", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "whale watching", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Saturday"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the last week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "from the 24th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t069-057", "text": "Siobhan's son Sam finishes primary school next month and starts at St Patrick's in September. Big change.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siobhan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "finishes primary school", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts at St Patrick's", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t069-059", "text": "Spoke to Saskia's husband Leon. Saskia hurt her calf in training and may have to pull out of the marathon. She's devastated. I should give her a ring this week, maybe Thursday evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saskia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leon", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saskia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "hurt her calf", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "devastated", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "give her a ring", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
